---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import LegalShell from "../components/LegalShell.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms" path="/terms/"><LegalShell title="Beta terms" description="Plain-language conditions for evaluating the SendArc beta.">
  <h2>Beta software</h2><p>SendArc is pre-release software provided for evaluation without warranty. Test it with non-critical workflows first, keep backups, and confirm every preview before sending.</p>
  <h2>Acceptable use</h2><p>Use SendArc only with accounts and applications you are authorized to operate. Do not use it for unsolicited bulk mail, credential theft, bypassing access controls, or unlawful content.</p>
  <h2>No payment</h2><p>The current Business Beta form is an expression of interest. It is not an order and no payment is collected. Any future paid offer will require separate, explicit terms.</p>
  <h2>Open-source license</h2><p>Software rights are governed by the repository license and notices. These site terms do not reduce rights granted by LGPL-3.0-or-later.</p>
</LegalShell></BaseLayout>
